WEBVTT

NOTE
The ending — Squall lost in time, reunited with Rinoa; the closing montage.
Duration: approximately 4 minutes 50 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
A close-up of Squall's scarred face.

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:27.150
Squall wanders alone through the disintegrating, time-compressed world.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:25.570
A glowing sunset flower field; Rinoa walks through it.

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:22.750
A tender recreation of the SeeD graduation-ball dance.

00:03:25.070 --> 00:03:28.110
Squall and Rinoa dance together once more.

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:04.000
A single white feather drifts down.
